%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorMargin": 25, "width": 120, "diagramMarginX": 10, "messageMargin": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Viewer or owner
    actor Op as Operator
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Job as Transcoding job
    participant Rek as Rekognition

    Job->>Job: 1 frame per 5 s,<br/>at most 120
    Job->>Rek: Image moderation,<br/>3 at a time
    Rek-->>Job: Labels, confidence
    Job->>Job: Policy: approved,<br/>flagged, blocked
    Job->>DB: READY and verdict,<br/>one conditional write
    Note over DB,Job: Flagged, blocked:<br/>in no listing

    opt A viewer reports
        User->>API: POST /videos/:id/<br/>report
        API->>DB: Report, one open<br/>per viewer
    end

    Op->>API: GET /admin/videos
    API-->>Op: Review queue
    Op->>API: PATCH .../moderation,<br/>decision, reason
    API->>DB: Snapshot verdict once,<br/>set verdict, close reports
    API->>DB: Append<br/>ModerationEvent

    opt Owner appeals a removal
        User->>API: POST /videos/:id/<br/>appeal
        API->>DB: Appeal, one<br/>per decision
        Op->>API: PATCH /admin/<br/>appeals/:id
        alt Upheld
            API->>DB: Approve:<br/>video restored
        else Rejected
            API->>DB: Removal kept
        end
    end
